{"duration_api_ms":8270,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3185d3a7-e475-440c-a20c-041f61227f3c","total_cost_usd":0.023576,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1101,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":738,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1101,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1101},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":738,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1101,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.023576,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Customer Support Ticket Classification\n\n**User ID:** user_a\n**Query:** \"Customer cannot login because the account is locked and needs a password reset.\"\n\n---\n\n## 1. Ticket Classification\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `account` (Account / Login) |\n\n**Rationale:** The query matches these category keywords: **\"login\"**, **\"locked\"**, **\"account\"** and **\"password\"**. `account` is also the configured `default_category`. No other category exists in the supplied data.\n\n## 2. Routing Decision\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **owner_team** | Account Support |\n\n## 3. Priority & SLA\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **priority** | P3 |\n| **sla** | 2 business days |\n\n## 4. Policy Application\n**Policy (frozen):** *\"Verify customer identity before changing account information or unlocking access.\"*\n\n**Applied:** The request asks to unlock the account and reset the password. Both count as changing account information or unlocking access. Identity verification is therefore **mandatory before** any unlock or reset takes place. No unlock or reset may happen until verification succeeds.\n\n## 5. Next Actions (in policy-compliant order)\n1. **Ask for identity verification.** This must be done first because the policy requires it.\n2. **Check account lock status.**\n3. **Provide password reset or unlock instructions.** Only do this after identity verification succeeds.\n\n---\n\n## Missing Information\nThe supplied data does not include the following. None of it has been assumed.\n- **Identity verification status:** It is unknown whether user_a has already been verified.\n- **Verification method:** The accepted verification steps or documents are not specified.\n- **Lock cause and current lock status:** The reason for the lock and how long it lasts are not provided.\n- **Reset / unlock procedure details:** No specific instructions, links or self-service flow are provided.\n- **Customer contact details / account identifiers:** None are provided beyond `user_id: user_a`.\n\n---\n\n**Fixture:** customer-support-2026-09-16-v2-account\n**SHA256:** 83a6225518b919e292a47d4f5a81d95d7d4fd2d3ad38eb3b8b8095b3b1451861","ttft_ms":8282,"type":"result","duration_ms":8307,"uuid":"753f7524-1be0-41ca-a4c0-c8b1f3f9e7cc","ttft_stream_ms":1434,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":1434,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
